<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

767
00:34:53.913 --> 00:34:56.613
<P Class=KoreanSC>Didn't you say that you had a job at Yuwen's?

768
00:34:56.613 --> 00:34:57.101
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

769
00:34:57.101 --> 00:34:58.541
