770
00:34:58.541 --> 00:34:59.476
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

771
00:34:59.476 --> 00:35:00.996
<P Class=KoreanSC>Don't mention it. What bad luck!

772
00:35:00.996 --> 00:35:01.559
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

773
00:35:01.559 --> 00:35:03.439
<P Class=KoreanSC>Today at Shouhua Mansion,

774
00:35:03.439 --> 00:35:04.361
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

775
00:35:04.361 --> 00:35:06.491
<P Class=KoreanSC>Yuwen Xiong sent wedding gifts to the third daughter of the Guo family.

776
00:35:06.491 --> 00:35:06.642
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

777
00:35:06.642 --> 00:35:08.662
<P Class=KoreanSC>What an important occasion!

778
00:35:08.662 --> 00:35:09.320
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

779
00:35:09.320 --> 00:35:10.520
<P Class=KoreanSC>Out of nowhere,

780
00:35:10.520 --> 00:35:12.142
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

781
00:35:12.142 --> 00:35:13.602
