00:36:36.532 --> 00:36:42.247
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

831
00:36:42.247 --> 00:36:44.406
<P Class=KoreanSC>In the past, you did not want to get involved.

832
00:36:44.406 --> 00:36:44.601
<P Class=KoreanSC>&nbsp;

833
00:36:44.601 --> 00:36:45.681
<P Class=KoreanSC>I didn't tell you either.

